OL,3,GNEWSAUS man jailed after stalking
OL,4,Avictim for 10 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who travelled from the USA to
OL,7,Fmeet a UK man he had been stalking for
OL,8,F10 years has been jailed after being
OL,9,Farrested at Gatwick Airport.
OL,11,FRobert Beckman, who lives in Ann Arbor,
OL,12,FMichigan, has been jailed for a year
OL,13,Fand nine months after admitting causing
OL,14,Fhis victim serious distress by sending
OL,15,Fhim messages online and by post, as
OL,16,Fwell as commenting on social media
OL,17,Fposts.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,330,320,200,140,0,100
