OL,3,GNEWSAUS man jailed after stalking
OL,4,Avictim for 10 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 31-year-old, who was arrested at
OL,7,FGatwick Airport by Sussex Police on 25
OL,8,FAugust after flying from Boston with
OL,9,Fthe intention of meeting the victim,
OL,10,Fpleaded guilty at a hearing last month.
OL,12,FAt Lewes Crown Court on Thursday,
OL,13,FBeckman was also handed a 10-year
OL,14,Frestraining order and ordered not to
OL,15,Fenter the UK.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
